# PLAN-997 legacy A2R trap certification extension — the four H-06 trap
# sources (B13/B14/B15/B20) certified in the trap domain: the EXPLICIT
# `legacy-a2r.checked-i32/1` profile emits source-int arithmetic checked
# at the i32 domain at operation time; a violation is a typed stderr
# event (auto.trap:<kind>:<op>) plus a controlled exit(70).
# a2r-ONLY by design: this suite is the daily zero-spawn face (emit +
# byte-compare against the G04-reviewed trap goldens at oracle/trap/);
# the real compile+run certification is the ace-certify --trap tool
# (never this suite), and the value domain (ace.m1.cert/1) is untouched.
# Default-profile bytes for every value cell remain frozen elsewhere.

```test-case
case {
  schema: "autolang.case/2"
  id: "ace.m1.a2rtrap.b13"
  tags: ["ace-m1", "a2r-trap-997"]
  links: ["PLAN-997"]
  source: { file: "src/B13.at", syntax: "auto", path: "main.at" }
  entry: { mode: "program" }
  checks: [
    { id: "a2r-trap-emit", adapter: "a2r", action: "emit", options: { module_name: "m1_b13", int_profile: "legacy-a2r.checked-i32/1" },
      expect: { completion: "success", artifacts: [
        { path: "m1_b13.rs", file: "oracle/trap/m1_b13.rs", compare: "bytes" } ] } }
  ]
}
```

